msgid ""
"Master identity details used by AI agents to automatically determine Debit "
"vs. Credit, invoice directions, and ledger accounts."
msgstr "用于让 AI 智能助理自动判定借贷方向、发票收付类型及记账科目的主体基础信息。"

msgid "How AI Determines Debit vs. Credit Using Your Profile"
